# Verification gate

One entry point: `python scripts/verify.py`. Local hooks are optional;
CI (`tests.yml`) is authoritative. Do not skip, weaken, or suppress
checks to obtain a green result.

- While implementing: `python scripts/verify.py --fast` or
  `python scripts/verify.py --fast -- tests/test_foo.py`
- Before ready: `python scripts/verify.py --full` (same as CI)
- Fix regressions this change caused. A later edit that affects checked
  behavior invalidates an earlier green run — rerun.
- Report exact commands and results. Never claim “all tests pass” from
  a subset. Name any check you could not run.
- Opt-in hook: `python scripts/install_pre_push_hook.py`
- Details: `docs/qa/verification.md`
